      "text": "No... I’m sorry to hear about your dog"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "12:38 PM",
      "text": "Thanks Anthony"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET ███████████████",
      "time": "12:38 PM",
      "text": "Hows the story? How are you??"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:38 PM",
      "text": "Yeah I felt for you... my cat Fuzzles died in February she was 20"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:38 PM",
      "text": "She still lived with my mom though"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:38 PM",
      "text": "And she’s a cat"
    }
  ]
